OL,3,ABotswana condemned for slaughtering
OL,4,Aelephants for independence celebrations
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnimal rights activists have criticised
OL,7,FBotswana's decision to authorise the
OL,8,Fkilling of 23 elephants to provide meat
OL,9,Ffor independence celebrations.
OL,11,FThe southern African country, home to
OL,12,Fthe world's largest elephant
OL,13,Fpopulation, is holding nationwide
OL,14,Ffestivities on Wednesday to mark the
OL,15,F60th anniversary of independence from
OL,16,FBritain.
OL,18,FA licence issued by the Ministry of
OL,19,FEnvironment and Tourism, seen by local
OL,20,Fmedia, authorises the hunting of 23
OL,21,Felephants and other wild animals for
OL,22,F"complimentary purposes".
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
