OL,3,ABotswana condemned for slaughtering
OL,4,Aelephants for independence celebrations
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Botswana-based Elephant Protection
OL,7,FSociety warns the decision could
OL,8,Fundermine conservation, with its
OL,9,Fchairman Oaitse Nawa telling the BBC
OL,10,Felephants needed greater protection.
